msgid "Restart the computer to start using MAN. A menu at every start lets you choose MAN or Windows; the temporary MAN installer partition is removed by MAN on its first start."
msgstr "Genstart computeren for at begynde at bruge MAN. En menu ved hver start lader dig vælge MAN eller Windows; den midlertidige installationspartition fjernes af MAN ved første start."

